  "notes": "[Download the Windows x64 installer](https://github.com/ca-works/eng-drawing-viewer/releases/download/v2.3.6-windows/ENG-Drawing-Viewer-2.3.6-Windows-x64-Setup.exe) for Windows 10 (1809 or later) or Windows 11.\n\n- **Image Editor controls** · Numeric fields fit at higher display scaling and in narrow windows. Edit values directly or use the sliders.\n- **On-canvas text** · Click the canvas and type, adjust the font size while editing, and resize committed text using the layer handles. Press Ctrl+Enter to commit or Esc to cancel.\n- **Excel workbooks in Reference** · Open .xlsx files offline with worksheet tabs, scrolling and cell copying. Saved formula results display when available.\n\nBuilt from source commit 02ca53c10d899658c458897ba35dc2dce5a0c3ad and tested through a per-user installation on Windows 11.\n\n[Windows source archive](https://github.com/ca-works/eng-drawing-viewer/releases/download/v2.3.6-windows/eng-drawing-viewer-2.3.6-source.zip) · [Third-party source references](https://github.com/ca-works/eng-drawing-viewer/releases/download/v2.3.6-windows/THIRD_PARTY_SOURCES-Windows-x64.txt) · [SHA-256 checksums](https://github.com/ca-works/eng-drawing-viewer/releases/download/v2.3.6-windows/SHA256SUMS.txt)\n",
